  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Biodiverse Landscapes Fund (BLF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK&apos;s Bio-diverse landscape fund aims to reduce poverty, protect and restore biodiversity and lessen the impact of climate change in six critical landscapes across the globe. ZSL is the Lead Delivery Partner, responsible for the overall governance of BLF in the Western Congo Basin (WCB). The ZSL-led consortium offers technical expertise and delivery track record to achieve the BLF WCB Landscape outputs while applying innovation and managing risk. We have constructed a consortium which brings together global expertise in gender, livelihoods, health, sustainable land management, protected area management, IWT and Climate.</narrative>
  </description>
